sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client input
  participant H as Human mob
  participant M as movementMachine
  participant CM as client.Move
  participant NM as Living / movable / native Move
  participant T as Collision target
  participant A as Mining action owner
  C->>H: direction start/stop updates held axes
  loop independent movement loop
    M->>H: read direction, movement and delay gates
    M->>CM: async Move(get_step, direction, diagonal)
    CM->>CM: canmove / moving / delay / map and actor gates
    opt opt-in physical sub-tile adapter
      CM->>H: eligibility and one-use pulse
    end
    CM->>NM: polymorphic movement after policy checks
    NM->>T: native passability / collision
    opt human collision
      T->>H: Bump
      H->>A: try_bump_mining; reserve actor and turf before spawn
      alt eligible mining
        A->>A: perform; do_after with exact actor/tool/turf/offset context
        A->>T: revalidate then mining effects
        A->>A: release reciprocal reservations
      else ordinary collision
        H->>NM: inherited Bump; deferred pushing
      end
    end
    M->>M: remove busy client; wait until move delay; re-add
  end
  Note over C,CM: Native movement handlers also enter client movement without waiting for held-input loop
